---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this personal website handles browsing, clinic appointment requests and business inquiries."
  light
>
  <div class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Information & choices</p>
    <h1>Privacy.</h1>
  </div>
  <article class="wrap reading">
    <p>
      Effective October 16, 2026. This personal website is operated by Jee Hoon
      Ju. For website and business-inquiry privacy questions, contact{" "}
      <a href="mailto:drjeeju@aetherheal.com">drjeeju@aetherheal.com</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Clinic appointment requests</h2>
    <p>
      Tune Clinic manages clinical appointment requests and subsequent care. The
      booking form submits directly to the clinic’s booking service hosted with
      Supabase in Seoul, South Korea. It collects your name, email, optional
      phone, preferred appointment, treatment interests, optional notes and the
      required consents. The website source is recorded to distinguish requests
      arriving here from requests on the clinic website.
    </p>
    <p>
      Personal-information consent and health-information consent are separate
      required choices. Requests for people who do not attend are retained for
      up to 12 months under the clinic’s booking disclosure. Records created
      during actual care follow the clinic’s record policies. No marketing
      consent is bundled with booking. Read{" "}
      <a href="https://tuneclinic-global.com/privacy">
        Tune Clinic’s privacy policy
      </a>{" "}
      for its full processing, service-provider, rights and contact details.
    </p>
    <h2>Business inquiries</h2>
    <p>
      The business form is separate from clinical booking. Your name, email,
      optional organization, message and consent record are stored in a private
      table in the Seoul Supabase project for responding to your inquiry.
      Authorized administrators can access these records. Please do not include
      health information. You can request access, correction or deletion through
      the email address above. Inquiry records are retained while the
      conversation is active and reviewed for deletion within 12 months of the
      last contact, unless a continuing agreement or applicable obligation
      requires retention.
    </p>
    <h2>Security and hosting</h2>
    <p>
      GitHub Pages hosts this website and may process technical connection
      information to serve it. Cloudflare Turnstile checks form submissions for
      abuse and may process device and network information. These providers may
      process technical data internationally. Form records are stored in Seoul;
      this does not mean every hosting or security request remains in Korea.
    </p>
    <p>
      See{" "}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        GitHub’s privacy statement
      </a>
      ,{" "}
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">
        Cloudflare’s privacy policy
      </a>{" "}
      and <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy">Supabase’s privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Where enabled, Google Analytics is loaded only after you choose to allow
      analytics. We measure page visits, reading depth, active reading time and
      selected navigation clicks. We do not send form fields or health details.
      Analytics is excluded from booking and business-inquiry pages. The URL
      query string and fragment are excluded from our events. Treatment and
      concern pages are grouped under the general care library rather than
      reporting the specific topic. Google may process analytics information
      internationally.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can change your choice with Cookie settings in the footer. Global
      Privacy Control is respected. Essential storage may hold a recent receipt
      indicator in your browser tab; it contains no contact or treatment
      details. See{" "}
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>External content and links</h2>
    <p>
      Clinic video thumbnails load from Tune Clinic; video files load only when
      you choose to play them. Opening an Instagram post takes you to Instagram,
      where its privacy practices apply. Email, WhatsApp and other external
      links are services outside this website.
    </p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can browse without optional analytics. If you prefer not to use a
      form, contact the clinic or business address directly. Please avoid
      including sensitive information in an initial business email.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
